{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n こんばちは\n \n ブログを見返していたら\n 私とめいのメイド服の画像が\n 神隠しにあっていました。\n だから載せます〜\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3HBFDJGJWKNCP6TQZXPDE7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n めいとささくの神隠し🗿\n \n \n 佐々木久美です🦒\n \n \n とっても報告が遅くなってしまったのですが、\n 現在販売中の「BUBKA2月号」さんに\n 高本と載せていただいています🍒🦒\n おたけと二人ってはじめてだったかなー？\n \n オフショットがあるので載せます〜👾\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3HBGDBTFYVQ67HDX19F054","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3HBHDXB5DFDV6RV7XWMS02","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3HBJD7DD4B2Z38DBT8D4V8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3HBKF2NSKWSQBCK05NM4XA","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n とっても楽しい撮影だったし\n 沢山いろいろなお話をしたので\n まだご覧になっていない方は\n 是非見てみてください🎅\n \n \n \n \n \n 最近寒すぎるので\n 暖かくして過ごしましょう🌋\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3HBMKBTAC20F47YBVFV0M0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3HBNMZAS1W2VHY7JSPYEPX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n これは薄着だ〜！（笑）\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3HBPPC1Y2RCZ6VVA30VEXW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 2021年感が未だにないので\n フィルターを使いまくって\n 実感を湧かしています⛲️\n \n \n \n \n ではまたね( ˙-˙ )/\n \n 佐々木久美"}],"source":"archive"}